From 2a80fc989a7bc1de03c4501ffd404cf276a23f36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Greg Chadwick <gac@lowrisc.org>
Date: Thu, 27 Jun 2024 18:05:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] [dv] Update testbench to use new 'pre_val' MIP

The 'pre_val' MIP addresses the scenario where MIP changes as an
instruction is excuting, this means a CSR instruction can observe a
different MIP from the one that decides whether or not that instruction
will be interrupted.
---
